{
  "Npcs.FemaleSpiderMorph.Desc": "The female spider-morph is completely nude, save for her thigh-high stockings and forearm-length gloves, which upon closer inspection, appear to actually be part of her body - her exoskeleton. Her exposed skin is pale as the full moon, save for the dusky skin of her nipples and the black-skinned delta of her sex. Her breasts and ass are both full and well-rounded, and just above her ass-cheeks there's a bulbous spider-abdomen. The spider-girl is currently eyeing you with a strange expression and her fangs bared."
